? What does the concurrence of $(|00\rangle+|11\rangle)/\sqrt2$ equal? ;; 0 ;; 0.5 ;; *1 ;; 2 || A Bell state is maximally entangled, so the concurrence is 1.
? What is $HH|0\rangle$? ;; |1⟩ ;; |+⟩ ;; *|0⟩ ;; |−⟩ || $H^2=I$, the two paths to $|1\rangle$ cancel.
? Which gate set is universal? ;; {H, S} ;; {H, S, CNOT} ;; *{H, T, CNOT} ;; {X, Z} || Clifford gates need T to become universal.
? Which gate flips the target only when BOTH controls are 1? ;; CNOT ;; SWAP ;; *Toffoli ;; CZ || Toffoli = controlled-controlled-NOT.
